+ * Region-adaptive vectorization for isometric pixel art.
+ *
+ * Uses a rotation-invariant heuristic that detects three pattern families
+ * at each crossing-diagonal site:
+ * - 2:1 horizontal staircases (isometric X/Z-axis lines)
+ * - 1:2 vertical staircases (isometric Y-axis lines)
+ * - 1:1 diagonal continuations (forward-facing / normal pixel art)
+ *
+ * Multi-step confirmation reduces false positives. The optimization pass
+ * accepts extended border slopes (2 and 0.5) for dimetric angles.
+ *
+ * If \p options.isometric_weight is 0, a default weight of 8 is used.
+ * \p options.optimize is respected (not forced).
+ */
